---
// Small home-page teaser pointing at /baseline — the product keeps one honest
// slot on the consulting home page instead of leaking into every section.
---
<section class="bg-card border-y border-white/7">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 md:py-14 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between gap-8">
    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
        <div class="w-6 h-px bg-accent flex-shrink-0"></div>
        <span class="min-w-0 font-display text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.22em] uppercase text-accent">Our Monitoring Platform</span>
      </div>
      <p class="font-display font-extrabold uppercase text-primary leading-tight mb-3" style="font-size: clamp(22px, 2.5vw, 34px);">
        BASELINE — Your Real OEE In Days
      </p>
      <p class="text-muted text-[15px] leading-relaxed">
        A small kit on the machines you already run, streaming live OEE, downtime, and
        MTBF to a dashboard on your own network. Pilots opening soon.
      </p>
    </div>
    <a
      href="/baseline"
      class="inline-flex self-start md:self-center items-center whitespace-nowrap border-2 border-accent text-accent hover:bg-accent hover:text-dark font-display font-bold text-[14px] tracking-[0.1em] uppercase px-6 py-3.5 transition-all duration-200"
    >
      See The Platform →
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
